#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/agentic-routing.rst:5
msgid "Agentic Routing"
msgstr "智能体路由"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/agentic-routing.rst:7
msgid "Agentic applications often generate multiple inference requests as part of the same logical session. These requests may come from multi-turn conversations, parallel tool calls, sub-agents, retries, or background tasks."
msgstr "智能体应用通常会在同一逻辑会话中生成多个推理请求。这些请求可能来自多轮对话、并行工具调用、子智能体、重试或后台任务。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/agentic-routing.rst:11
msgid "AIBrix's session-affinity routing strategy keeps related requests on the same inference pod whenever possible. This improves KV-cache reuse and avoids repeatedly rebuilding the same context on different pods."
msgstr "AIBrix 的会话亲和性路由策略会尽可能将相关请求保留在同一个推理 Pod 上。这可提高 KV-cache 复用率，并避免在不同 Pod 上反复重建相同的上下文。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/agentic-routing.rst:15
msgid "AIBrix supports two ways to maintain session affinity:"
msgstr "AIBrix 支持两种维持会话亲和性的方式："

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/agentic-routing.rst:17
msgid "``x-session-id`` — gateway-issued affinity for sequential, multi-turn requests."
msgstr "``x-session-id`` — 由网关签发，适用于顺序发送的多轮请求。"

#: ../../../../Users/zhenyu.jiang/go/src/golanglearning/new_project/aibrix/docs/source/features/agentic-routing.rst:18
msgid "``x-aibrix-session-key`` — caller-provided affinity for concurrent and agentic requests."
msgstr "``x-aibrix-session-key`` — 由调用方提供，适用于并发请求和智能体请求。"

