msgid "If your agent framework already provides ``x-aibrix-session-key`` for session affinity, no additional session identifier is required for these PD routing policies."
msgstr "如果智能体框架已经提供 ``x-aibrix-session-key`` 来实现会话亲和性，则这些 PD 路由策略无需额外的会话标识符。"

